  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your movements cannot be predicted.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Lightning Stance<sup>CRB</sup>, 3rd mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If you move more than 5 feet, you gain 50% concealment for 1 round. If you expend one use of mythic power, you gain this concealment for one minute rather than 1 round.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc210\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
